{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1ozp2z2Z9yDRkQkMTrV", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I filed one bug and signed off, but I only partly covered the sweep, so confidence is low (0.4).\n\n**Bug filed (developer confirmed and logged it):** Profile > Bonuses lists only the Attack and Hitpoints prestige bonuses and a Construction entry. The Infinite Tower bonuses (+7% XP, +12% coin drops, +150 HP), Mercantile 99 and the three guild quests don't appear. This is the \"new set of sources\" change.\n\n**Looked correct:**\n- **Smithing XP bar:** at 4,400 XP the Smithing bar showed about 0.859. That matches progress from the start of level 19 (about 3,971 XP) to level 20 at 4,470 XP.\n- **Action order:** the Mining, Fishing and Woodcutting action lists were sorted by required level, lowest first.\n- **Achievements:** the achievement list agreed with the character data. First Mastery (any skill at 99) is checked, which fits Mercantile 99.\n\n**Not checked:**\n- **Profile milestones section:** I couldn't find it on the profile or in Achievements, so the mission-milestone progress change is untested.\n- **Action order:** I couldn't confirm the order for Cooking or Crafting, because those lists don't show required levels. Scrolling the Smithing list was unreliable, so I only saw its Bronze items, all at level 1.\n- **Other checks:** I didn't do rotation or state-persistence checks.\n- **Construction bonus:** I didn't confirm the -7% Construction bonus against the character's actual Construction level."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 404, "cache_read_input_tokens": 43298, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 404}, "output_tokens": 524, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformation